  "article": {
    "images": [],
    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The historical drama "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "Swords Into Plowshares"
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "",
            "zh": "《太平年》"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " takes us back to the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Five Dynasties and Ten Kingdoms period",
            "zh": "五代十国时期"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", an "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "era",
            "ref": "v-era"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " between the Tang and the Song dynasties. It was a time of war and "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "chaos",
            "ref": "v-chaos"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Watching it, we can’t help but wonder: How can people "
          },
          {
            "t": "underline",
            "v": "beat swords into plowshares"
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "",
            "zh": "犁头"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " — end war and achieve peace?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The era lasted only a little more than half a century, but it was one of the most "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "violent",
            "ref": "v-violent"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " times in Chinese history. The land was "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "split",
            "zh": "分裂"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " into different parts. Whoever controlled the army could take over by "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "force",
            "ref": "v-force"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Many cities were burned to ashes, and people "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "suffered",
            "ref": "v-suffer"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Many were killed or forced to leave their homes."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The drama follows "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Qian Hongchu",
            "zh": "钱弘俶"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", the last king of "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Wuyue",
            "zh": "吴越"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". In 978, near the end of his "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "reign",
            "zh": "统治"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", he faces a difficult decision. He can either fight to keep his kingdom, or give up the land to protect the people. To avoid more deaths, he chooses to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "hand over",
            "ref": "v-hand-over"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " Wuyue and join the Song dynasty, helping to unify China."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Some might call "
          },
          {
            "t": "underline",
            "v": "this"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "defeat",
            "ref": "v-defeat"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", but the show invites us to see it differently. In a world where most rulers fought for land, "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "wealth",
            "ref": "v-wealth"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", and honour, Qian put his people first. Yes, it is a defeat for Qian, but it is also the bravest choice—to put down the swords and let peace win."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "vocabulary": [
      {
        "id": "v-era",
